=== bind lists and queries
backward-char can be invoked via "\C-b", "\C-t", "\e[D".
kill-whole-line is not bound to any keys.
"\C-t": backward-char
"\eb": backward-word
# kill-whole-line (not bound)
yank-pop can be found on "\ey".
"\C-o": "zz"
"\ez": "macro text"
"\C-g": "READLINE_LINE=\"[$READLINE_LINE]\"; READLINE_POINT=2"
43
set bell-style audible
